<title>USA: Pope &amp; Talbot names Day CFO.</title>
<headline>Pope &amp; Talbot names Day CFO.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pope &amp; Talbot Inc Monday named Robert Day as its new chief financial officer, replacing Carlos Lamadrid, who is retiring after 17 years with the company.</p>
<p>In a statement, Pope &amp; Talbot said Day brings 18 years of experience with Simpson Investment Co, a privately held forest products company.</p>
<p>Pope &amp; Talbot, based in Portland, Ore., makes paper, pulp and wood products.</p>
</text>
